            <title>[IGNITE-12732] SQL: KILL QUERY command hangs on query when query cursor is held by user or leak</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12732</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Execute a query&lt;br/&gt;
2. Don&apos;t close the query cursor, don&apos;t iterate to the end of results.&lt;br/&gt;
3. Run &quot;KILL QUERY&quot; command. The command hangs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
